  "description": "Welcome to the St. Jude's Code Arena - by St. Jude's Public School (SJPS), Nilgiris! An online coding challenge for aspiring coders. About the Opportunity: Step into the St. Jude's Code Arena, an exciting online coding challenge hosted by St. Jude's Public School (SJPS), Nilgiris. This event is designed for individuals eager to test and showcase their programming skills in a dynamic, virtual environment. Prepare to engage with challenging problems that will push your coding skills to the next level. This is your chance to hone your abilities in Python and sharpen your logical reasoning skills. Whether you're looking to gain experience, compete with peers, or simply enjoy the thrill of problem-solving, the St. Jude's Code Arena offers a unique platform to learn and grow in the field of technology. Eligibility and Registration: St. Jude's Code Arena is a competition only for students in Grades 9–12. Languages Supported: C C++ Java Python 3+ Competition Structure: The structure for this online coding challenge is as follows: As this is an online coding challenge, participants will engage in problem-solving directly through their digital environment. Rewards and Prizes: Rewards and prize details (as provided): 1st Place - Cash Prize 2nd Place - Gifts 3rd Place - Certificate Join the St. Jude's Code Arena and demonstrate your coding talent in this engaging online challenge!",
